# Allowlist for BOTH Vercel projects built from this repository (Vercel applies this root file to each):
#
# 1. Asset CDN (repo root, production = main): vercel.mjs → tools/build-cdn.mjs copies css/, js/ and
#    assets/ into dist/, the only folder it serves. Nothing else listed here becomes public on it.
# 2. CMS (Root Directory "cms", faithworks-cms.vercel.app): Next.js shell around the CMS. It needs its
#    dashboard, API, build script and seed fixture; its page preview imports tools/ and reads data/*.json
#    and assets/icons. Never the CMS's .env files, local data, backups, tests or SQL.
#
# Without the cms/ lines the CMS build fails with "Cannot find module .../cms/scripts/build-static.mjs".
/*
!/vercel.mjs
!/tools
!/css
!/js
!/assets
!/google8e0d95c12a780efd.html
!/data
/data/migration
!/cms
/cms/*
!/cms/shared
!/cms/package.json
!/cms/package-lock.json
!/cms/vercel.json
!/cms/next.config.mjs
!/cms/app
!/cms/server
!/cms/scripts
!/cms/public
!/cms/fixtures
